<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">26042026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>A gunman with a shotgun rushed the security checkpoint at the Washington Hilton last night, minutes after President Trump took the stage at the correspondents' dinner.</s> <s>Trump and Vice President Vance were evacuated uninjured as Secret Service agents tackled the shooter and hundreds of guests dove under banquet tables.</s> <s>It's the most serious physical breach against a sitting US president since Butler in twenty twenty-four... at the same hotel where Reagan was shot in nineteen eighty-one.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The Justice Department is pursuing three hundred eighty-four denaturalization cases, alleging political sympathies were undisclosed at the moment of the citizenship oath.</s> <s>Stripping citizenship was a Cold War tool used fewer than ten times a year for two decades. It's now being deployed at industrial scale, with at least forty-one cases involving Palestinian-solidarity advocacy.</s> <s>Those stripped lose all immigration status and face removal — creating, in effect, a two-tier citizenship where the naturalized can be deported for speech the native-born may freely make.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Hungary, the Tisza movement took one hundred forty-one seats, crossing the supermajority line that allows constitutional rewrites.</s> <s>Péter Magyar, a former Fidesz insider, can now dismantle the electoral laws and judicial appointment rules Viktor Orbán engineered over sixteen years.</s> <s>Orbán's quitting parliament but staying on as Fidesz leader — the European Union's most prominent illiberal model lost to a defector who ran on the same machine its architect built.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Gunfire reached General Goita's residence in Kati this weekend as armed groups linked to al-Qaeda struck five Malian cities at once.</s> <s>Mali's junta expelled UN peacekeepers and French forces in favour of Russian mercenaries, and the security trade hasn't held.</s> <s>No group has claimed responsibility... and Bamako has not announced an operational response.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Russian missiles struck the same apartment block in Dnipro twice in twenty hours, hitting the rescuers who arrived after the first strike.</s> <s>Ten people were killed across Ukraine on Saturday, the regional governor said, while President Zelenskyy signed agreements in Azerbaijan and pressed the European Union to advance accession talks.</s> <s>The double-tap pattern is now a documented Russian tactic — and it's reshaping how Ukrainian emergency services approach any fresh impact site.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Israeli forces killed three Palestinians, including a child, in four separate strikes on Gaza on Saturday.</s> <s>The attacks hit Sheikh Radwan, Jabalia, and the Al-Dahyan school, violating the October twenty twenty-five ceasefire that has no enforcement mechanism.</s> <s>Medical sources now count seventy-two thousand five hundred eighty-five Palestinians killed since October twenty twenty-three.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Iranian envoy Araghchi left Islamabad before the second round of US-Iran talks could begin. American envoys Witkoff and Kushner never arrived.</s> <s>Tehran refuses to negotiate while the Hormuz blockade continues and now demands a non-aggression guarantee, with Pakistan's military chief brokering future contact.</s> <s>Strait crossings have fallen from one hundred thirty ships a day to a handful, and Brent crude is nearly fifty percent above pre-war levels.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Ecuador cancelled a copper mine in its cloud forests... and then paid the foreign investor twenty-four million dollars in arbitration.</s> <s>Investor-state rules in three thousand treaties let foreign firms sue governments over revoked licences, but affected communities have no reciprocal right to sue investors.</s> <s>Colombia's president is now weighing withdrawal as one hundred twenty-nine domestic oil and mining claims pile up — an unelected arbitral system overriding democratically passed climate laws.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan's auto kit imports hit one and forty-seven hundredths billion dollars, up one hundred sixteen percent year-on-year, while new assemblers refuse to disclose local-content ratios.</s> <s>The twenty twenty-one industrial policy required fifty percent localisation by this year. Vendors say actual local content sits below eighteen percent on most models.</s> <s>It's a textbook industrial-policy failure — protectionism captured by importers wearing local clothes — and the policy expires June thirtieth.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Renewables overtook coal in global electricity generation for the first time last year, the energy think tank Ember reported.</s> <s>Europe's new AccelerateEU package cuts electricity taxes but leaves out gas price caps and windfall levies. Tax changes need unanimous approval among member states.</s> <s>Energy Commissioner Dan Jørgensen warned that gas prices will stay elevated for years yet, even as the generation mix tilts.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>President Macron pledged the Strait of Hormuz would reopen, as he put it, in coming days, with more than a dozen states offering to join a French-British escort mission Washington has declined to support.</s> <s>Energy analysts estimate a fifth of the world's oil simply cannot reach markets right now.</s> <s>TotalEnergies chief Patrick Pouyanne warned the disruption is no longer hypothetical — refineries are already rerouting cargoes that will not arrive.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Genome sequencing of soft coral colonies along the Western Antarctic Peninsula has revealed three distinct genetic clusters with strong isolation by distance — far less mixing than Marine Protected Area design assumes.</s> <s>The Antarctic Peninsula is the fastest-warming marine area on Earth, and these slow-growing corals anchor the seafloor ecosystem.</s> <s>Local collapses, the authors warn, won't be repaired by recolonisation from neighbours. Once gone, gone.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers at Tilburg University found that workers offered bonuses set lower self-imposed goals and produced less than colleagues offered nothing at all.</s> <s>The bonus reframed the activity from intrinsic challenge to transactional, and workers anchored on the lowest target the bonus would still reward.</s> <s>It's evidence against decades of corporate-incentive theory — with implications for teacher pay, conditional cash transfers, and even how artificial intelligence labs structure reward functions.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A review in Nature has set the first engineering framework for nanomotors that swim along chemical gradients the way bacteria do.</s> <s>The framework covers fuel sources, gradient-sensing, and collective behaviour for blood-compatible motors that could one day target tumours directly.</s> <s>No clinical deployment has begun. The paper marks a maturing field rather than a single breakthrough.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Ukraine has converted its nineteen-eighties Antonov An-twenty-eight turboprops into airborne launchers for cheap interceptor drones that hunt incoming Shaheds.</s> <s>A Shahed costs Russia about fifty thousand dollars; the Ukrainian P-one Sun interceptor costs four hundred. The platform already has two hundred twenty-two confirmed kills.</s> <s>Every NATO and Gulf air defence is rebuilding around this idea — military-industrial history made by improvisation under fire, not by a primes' research division.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Cloud compute prices for non-AI workloads have surged as hyperscalers redirect chips to AI training contracts. A two-terabyte solid-state drive that cost one hundred fifty-nine dollars now costs five hundred seventy-five.</s> <s>Several US cities are blocking new data-centre construction over rising power and water costs.</s> <s>The hidden tax of the AI race is being paid by every business that runs servers — hospitals, city offices, and academic researchers who can't outbid the frontier labs.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Anthropic's Mythos system flagged decentralised-finance exploits that human auditors had missed, mapping how minor flaws chain into systemic failures across shared liquidity pools.</s> <s>Hayden Adams of Uniswap warned the technology will split protocols into those that can afford continuous AI auditing and those that cannot.</s> <s>The same capability that defends contracts can probe them — and the offensive version will not stay in friendly hands for long.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>